Package: superawesomemagicalbrowser
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SuperAwesomeMagical <superawesomemagicalbrowser@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: ladybird (>= @LADYBIRD_MIN@), python3
Provides: www-browser, gnome-www-browser
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/603Madison/SuperAwesomeMagicalBrowser
Description: Ladybird with your tabs down the side, in the SuperAwesomeMagical look
 SuperAwesomeMagical Browser is Ladybird, the independent browser, set up the
 SuperAwesomeMagical way: tabs down the left side, Lexend for the interface and
 for pages, the Lavender colour, Ecosia for searches, ads and trackers blocked,
 and a start page with a big clock over the northern lights.
 .
 Ladybird itself is the 'ladybird' package from Ladybird's own repository
 (apt.ladybird.org), which keeps it up to date. It runs in a profile of its own.
